msgid "Overly Self-conscious"
msgstr ""

#. max 1999 bytes
msgctxt "1"
msgid "Rin Tohsaka's first SG.\nRin herself describes it as:\n\"queenly behavior, imposed by one's nobility,\nand completely natural for a ruler.\"\nIndeed, its meaning is unclear.\n\nAnother name for it is \"templation\".\nIt comes from the word \"template\", as in model or standard,\nand was a popular slang term in 21st century Japan.\n             ◆\n\nHumans may, in various moods and circumstances,\nreject what they like by saying they don't like them,\nor accept what they hate by saying they don't hate them.\n\nThe opposite of goodwill isn't ill will, but indifference.\n\nTo like is the other side of hate.\nTo hate is the other side of like.\nThis kind of \"dishonesty\" happens to everyone.\nIt's nothing to be particularly ashamed of.\n\nHowever, there're also cases where those who are prideful\nbehave haughtily to the one they're interested in,\nengaging in contradictory behavior.\nBut of course, we wouldn't dare say who.\n\nThis templation shifts from \"my my, not being very honest\"\nto \"uhh wait, aren't we enemies already?,\"\na condition oddly specific to girls.\n\nTheir prideful act is called \"tsuntsun\", and when\ntheir dependency reaches critical, they turn \"deredere\"―――\nin other words, the completion of a \"tsundere\".\n\nBut of course, we wouldn't dare say who.\n\n             ◆\n\nTemplation is fated to disappear when love is fulfilled,\nso it could be called a bittersweet SG.\nA certain priest said this.\n\"Once she confesses to her love interest and is fulfilled,\n she #RUBS   or anything#RUBEis 'tsun'#REND no longer. Only a despicable, impure being.\"\n\nUnfortunately, all that lies past graduation from this SG\nis becoming an idiotic couple so wrapped up in their love,\nthey don't even notice that people are watching.\nIf you're a well-meaning third party, you'll probably have\nyour own thoughts of it, but please kindly watch over them.\n"
msgstr ""

